                        <p class="itemintroduction"><u><span class="title">Cybersalt News</span></u></p>
                        <p class="itemparagraph">Oh look, chicken Thursday!</p>
                        <p class="itemparagraph">I know Christmas is still more than a month away, but the Cybersalt site was visited by a <strong>Christmas troll</strong> today. By troll I am referring to people who leave mean and/or rude comments on web sites. They don't  have anything constructive to say - they just want to jump at you and yell like trolls. But that's OK, because the weather around Cybersalt World Headquarters is heading towards freezing so a new addition to the<strong> Hall of Flames</strong> will help keep things warm:<br />
                        <a class="featuredlink" href="http://www.cybersalt.org/news/letters/hall-of-flames">http://www.cybersalt.org/news/letters/hall-of-flames</a></p>
                        <p class="itemparagraph">In other news, what's more fun than opening a can of worms and less fun than a barrel of monkeys? If you guessed a <strong>wheelbarrow of orangutans</strong> you win!<br />
                        <a class="featuredlink" href="http://www.cybersalt.org/funny-misc-pictures/5459">http://www.cybersalt.org/funny-misc-pictures/5459</a></p>
                        <p class="itemparagraph">Enjoy the rest of today's digest.</p>
                        <hr />
